   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are simplifying and reducing complexity across bp and plan to deliver at least $2 billion of cash cost savings by the end of 2026 through high grading our portfolio, digital transformation, supply chain efficiencies and global capability hubs.",
   "file": "20240507_BP_1Q24-Part-1-of-1.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-09",
